Women and men are creating the world we live in, and their contributions are invaluable.)&#x20;

### **Discrimination is not acceptable**


#### Gender stereotypes can severely impact a person’s self-worth. They may be disrespected, underpaid, and pressured into living a certain life that stifle their passions and creativity. Engaging men and women in passionate discussions about human rights is refreshing news in today’s society, and promoting equality is one of the most powerful natural weapons ever wielded.&#x20;
